{"id":"5f601f1cd0bd47fa","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-reverse-mathematics.md","title":"Reverse Mathematics","display":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reverse Mathematics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-reverse-mathematics","aliases":["72-df-reverse-mathematics"],"display":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reverse Mathematics","depends_on":["[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-reverse-mathematics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-reverse-mathematics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reverse-mathematics — Reverse Mathematics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\">\\(B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\">\\(\\varphi,A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2\">\\(\\vdash_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B+A:=B\\cup\\{A\\}\">\\(B+A:=B\\cup\\{A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow (B\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_2\\varphi)\\land(B\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_2 A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RMStrength}_B(\\varphi)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E):\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow (B\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_2\\varphi)\\land(B\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_2 A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RMStrength}_B(\\varphi)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E):\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向与逆向使用同一个基理论和有限演算。若候选原则是无穷公理模式，应把第二分句改为逐实例可证，而不是把模式直接当作一个句子。本节点只定义单句版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$，$\\varphi,A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$；$\\vdash_2$ 取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$B+A:=B\\cup\\{A\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2","display":false},{"tex":"B+A:=B\\cup\\{A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)&:\\Longleftrightarrow (B\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_2\\varphi)\\land(B\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_2 A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RMStrength}_B(\\varphi)&:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E):\\operatorname{RMEquiv}_B(\\varphi,A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1377,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-reverse-mathematics|df-reverse-mathematics — Reverse Mathematics]]"}],"outgoing":["b63a805280ad1d8e"]}